"<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"><title>Were Gwinnett Schools Better in the 2000s? | GCPS Data</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Compare Gwinnett school results since 2004. See how the graduation gap narrowed across ten high schools and why district reading scores tell a different story.\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Were Gwinnett schools better when you were a kid?\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Five Gwinnett high schools gained 13.5 points in graduation on average. Explore which schools caught up and what district averages hide.\"><script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@graph\":[{\"@type\":\"Article\",\"headline\":\"Were Gwinnett County Public Schools better in the 2000s?\",\"description\":\"Compare Gwinnett school results since 2004. See how the graduation gap narrowed across ten high schools and why district reading scores tell a different story.\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"Michael Yang\"},\"publisher\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"All Things Gwinnett\"},\"citation\":[\"https://ted.cviog.uga.edu/financial-documents/sites/default/files/budgetdoc/financial-report/school-district-gwinnett-county-school-district-gwinnett-county-fy2013-financial-report.pdf\",\"https://www.gpb.org/news/2010/10/19/gwinnett-schools-win-prestigious-prize\",\"https://educationrecoveryscorecard.org/wp-content/uploads/2025/02/report_GA_1302550_gwinnett-county.pdf\",\"https://www.gcpsk12.org/news-details/~board/news-releases/post/gcps-graduation-rate-reaches-highest-point-in-a-decade-for-second-year-in-a-row\",\"https://www.gcpsk12.org/get-connected/district-news-and-communication/all-news/gcps-full-news-article/~board/news-releases/post/graduation-rates-are-on-the-rise-across-gcps\",\"https://www.gcpsk12.org/news-details/~board/news-releases/post/gwinnett-sat-results-top-national-average\",\"https://resources.finalsite.net/images/v1759332983/fultonschoolsorg/oswe4noo5uojmnyqlssb/SATExecutiveSummary2025.pdf\",\"https://goews.georgia.gov/dashboards-data-report-card/downloadable-data\",\"https://goews.georgia.gov/dashboards-data-report-card/data-dashboards/hs-grad-outcomes\",\"https://www.gwinnettcounty.com/static/departments/planning/Census/census_2000_selected_income_and_poverty_status_characteristics.pdf\",\"https://www.gcpsk12.org/schools/clusters/list-of-schools-by-cluster\",\"https://www2.census.gov/programs-surveys/acs/summary_file/\",\"https://api.censusreporter.org/1.0/data/show/acs2024_5yr?table_ids=B19013,B17001,B07010&geo_ids=05000US13135\",\"https://www2.census.gov/geo/tiger/\",\"https://data.bls.gov/timeseries/CUUR0000SA0\",\"https://services3.arcgis.com/jEYjQXUX2JTVoctH/ArcGIS/rest/services/High_School_Zone_22_23/FeatureServer/21\",\"https://nces.ed.gov/pubs2003/2003604.pdf\",\"https://goews.georgia.gov/directcert\",\"https://www.gcpsk12.org/about-us/divisions-and-teams/facilities-and-operations/school-nutrition-program/provision-2-breakfast\"],\"inLanguage\":\"en-US\",\"@id\":\"#article\",\"hasPart\":[{\"@id\":\"#data-enrollment\"},{\"@id\":\"#data-math\"},{\"@id\":\"#data-reading\"},{\"@id\":\"#data-historical-graduation\"},{\"@id\":\"#data-four-year-graduation\"},{\"@id\":\"#faq\"},{\"@id\":\"#data-graduation-gap\"},{\"@id\":\"#household-map\"}]},{\"@type\":\"Dataset\",\"@id\":\"#data-enrollment\",\"name\":\"How fast did GCPS grow?\",\"description\":\"How fast did GCPS grow?. District enrollment, fiscal years 2004–2010. Reported years: 2004, 2005, 2006, 2007, 2008, 2009, 2010.\",\"temporalCoverage\":\"2004/2010\",\"spatialCoverage\":\"Gwinnett County Public Schools, Georgia, United States\",\"variableMeasured\":\"District enrollment, fiscal years 2004–2010\",\"citation\":[\"https://ted.cviog.uga.edu/financial-documents/sites/default/files/budgetdoc/financial-report/school-district-gwinnett-c